4. Confirm contract and service data responsibilities.
5. Define billing and payment references.
6. Validate partial payment and allocation requirements.
7. Confirm ERP integration and reconciliation.
8. Validate ID and MY separately.
9. Obtain merchant, DOKU Product, Engineering, Finance, and Operations sign-off.

